duration exercise.\nSports drinks shouldn't make you fat\nPalatinose prolongs your energy supply, without the boatloads of sugar and high-fructose corn syrup found in most sports drinks. Derived from beets, Palatinose is a non-GMO, low-glycermic sugar that gives you just the right amount of fuel."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Calci-K and TRAACS are registered trademarks of Albion Laboratories, Inc."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"2 Perform"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Hydration mix\nPromotes sustained performance\nFor any time you sweat"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested use: As a dietary supplement, take one scoop mixed with eight ounces of water or your favorite beverage."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Consult a medical doctor before taking this or any other nutritional supplement if you are pregnant, nursing, have or suspect a medical condition, or are taking any medications."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if freshness seal is missing or broken."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2019-12-22","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4